    "Program call flow": "sequenceDiagram\n    participant M as Main\n    participant G as Game\n    participant P as Paddle\n    participant B as Ball\n    participant C as Collision\n    M->>P: new Paddle(...)\n    M->>B: new Ball(...)\n    M->>G: new Game(width,height,P,B,bricks,lives)\n    M->>G: tick(dt)\n    activate G\n    G->>B: integrate position (x+=vx*dt, y+=vy*dt)\n    G->>G: handle walls (left/right/top reflect; bottom-out life reset)\n    G->>P: asRect() for paddle collision\n    G->>C: circleIntersectsRect(B, P.asRect())\n    C-->>G: boolean + penetration axes\n    G->>B: reflect velocity on min-penetration axis if collided\n    loop for each brick (stop after first hit)\n        G->>C: circleIntersectsRect(B, brick.rect)\n        C-->>G: boolean + penetration axes\n        alt hit\n            G->>B: reflect velocity on min axis\n            G->>brick: hit()\n            G->>G: if brick destroyed & breakable -> remove, score+=100\n        end\n    end\n    G-->>M: state updated (score/lives/flags)\n    deactivate G",
